  "body": "Maintenance release after 1.3.3:\r\n- No need for any manual work to get HTTPS. The card self-generates everything necessary on its own.\r\n- Firmware support for browsers downloading directly to the SD card.\r\n\r\nTo install:\r\n- Put FIRMWARE.BIN at the top of your SD card\r\n- If your Golden Boot version is < B2.0.6 (see \"About\" tab in config menu), put BOOT.BIN at the top of your SD card\r\n- Power cycle the card\r\n- When it reboots it will automatically update FIRMWARE.BIN to F1.3.4.\r\n- If you put BOOT.BIN in the SD card, then go in the boot menu to the \"About\" tab and press ENTER, to update the Golden Boot. Follow the prompt.\r\n\r\n"
